      "body": "\r\n\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\nFixes #58155 \r\nDeepSeek V4 thinking mode accepts `temperature`, `presence_penalty`,\r\nand `frequency_penalty` for API compatibility but should ignore them.\r\n\r\nThis change ignores those request overrides only when:\r\n\r\n- The resolved architecture is DeepSeek V4.\r\n- Thinking mode is enabled.\r\n\r\nOther models and DeepSeek V4 non-thinking requests retain their existing\r\nsampling behavior.\r\n\r\nNo existing open PR was found for #58155 or this sampling behavior.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npython -m pytest \\\r\n  tests/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/test_serving_chat.py \\\r\n  -k deepseek_v4_thinking_sampling_overrides -q\r\n\r\npre-commit run --files \\\r\n  vllm/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/serving.py \\\r\n  tests/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/test_serving_chat.py\r\n  \r\n  ```\r\n  \r\n## Test Result\r\nAll pre-commit checks passed, including Ruff and mypy.\r\n96 isolated conversion-boundary cases passed.\r\nFull pytest collection could not run locally because the macOS arm64\r\nenvironment has no compatible precompiled vLLM runtime.\r\nModel evaluation was not run because DeepSeek V4 cannot be served on\r\nthis development machine. Linux CI is requested for the repository test.\r\n",
